    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense for the timeline part. The thing is, the discrepancies aren't tied to any one person or a single department. They just seem to \"appear\" out of nowhere in the accounts, almost like they're just small, nagging errors that aren't quite being caught by the standard checks. Is there a more granular way to categorize these types of anomalies so I can see if there's a hidden logic to how they're occurring?",
