      "content": "You can categorize these anomalies by invoice characteristics, such as whether the currency differs from the plant's standard, if the date falls outside normal permissive hours, or if the seller's name does not match your registered vendors. Grouping the errors by these non-personal variables will reveal if the source lies in system error, manual entry mistakes, or systemic procedural gaps rather than intentional fraud. This granular filtering helps isolate the root cause efficiently without distracting from the larger operational picture.",
