      "content": "You should characterize them in your report as \"systemic ledger volatility\" or \"recurring peripheral variance\" to objectively acknowledge the pattern without implying malintent. Focusing your description on \"procedural inconsistencies during standard reconciliation cycles\" shifts the blame from individuals to the process itself, making it easier for management to see the issue as a efficiency gap rather than a suspicion trigger. By framing the data as a signal for \"enhanced automation of threshold alerts,\" you propose a clear, non-invasive solution that addresses the root cause without escalating the situation unnecessarily.",
